Port into EdgeStream-VLM (perception/) — changes relative to AERO-MOT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* tracker/: copied from aeromot/tracker (FairMOT baseline removed). Changes:
  - core/tracker.py: VisDrone-specific switches moved to config
    (minority_large_classes, class_penalty, qam_beta_modulation); the nested
    O(T*D) `_build_qam_cost` loop replaced by the vectorised
    `_qam_candidate_cost` (numerically identical, see tests/test_qam_cost.py).
  - core/base.py + core/tracker.py: the class-level id counter
    (MCBaseTrack._count_dict) became a per-tracker IdCounter, so several
    trackers (cameras) in one process no longer share or reset each other's ids.
  - ops/association_ops.py: cython_bbox is optional; NumPy fallback keeps the
    same +1-pixel IoU convention.
* models/detector.py: rewritten inference-only wrapper of YoloFalconModel with
  strict checkpoint loading and lazy EAD/LQC registration.
* models/lqc.py: aeromot/nn/modules/latent_query_context.py without the
  import-time `register_lqc()` call.
* postprocess.py: aeromot/nn/postprocess/postprocessor.py (unchanged).
* preprocess.py / perceptor.py: new; preprocessing now matches training
  (RGB + ImageNet normalisation) and low-score candidates reach the tracker.
